steps.context:
Write a weekly review summary to /tmp/weekly_review_event.md using your FILE EDITOR TOOL (not a terminal command). Format:

# Weekly Review — {date}

## Shipped
{concise list of what actually shipped this week}

## Stalled
{what didn't move and why}

## Interrupt Themes
{patterns noticed across this week's interrupts}

## Next Week Focus
{top 1-3 priorities approved above}

## Direction Check
{one sentence: on track / course corrected / pivoting — and why}

Then run: `bash .exocortex/scripts/create_event.sh --body-file /tmp/weekly_review_event.md` followed by `bash .exocortex/scripts/sync_event_to_vault.sh $(ls -t .exocortex/events/*.md 2>/dev/null | head -1)`. Show one line: '✓ Weekly review saved and synced' or '✓ Weekly review saved (sync skipped — no RAG key)'.
